roduction, so I rolled back to it. No change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried once, and that completed the rollout to all regions.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident **INC-0001** for checkout-api. The request timed out, so I checked the incident list before doing anything else. The incident had been created, so I did not open a duplicate. It describes the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state.\n\nFollow-ups for on-call:\n- Confirm checkout is working normally.\n- Investigate the rollback orchestrator's partial failure.\n- Do not redeploy v2.3.1 until it is fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}